[size=6][b]Race Passives[/b][/size]
[size=4]New passives for every race, with a slider so you decide how strong they are.[/size]

[line]

[b]What this is[/b]
I wanted racial passives I could actually tune, so I made some. Every playable race gets 2-3 new ones, and there's a slider for each race in an in-game menu. If a passive feels too strong, turn it down. If you want a Nord who shrugs off winter, turn it up. Per race, per character.

[line]

[b]You'll need[/b]
[list]
[*][url=https://skse.silverlock.org/]SKSE64[/url]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/32444]Address Library for SKSE Plugins[/url]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/120352]SKSE Menu Framework[/url] - optional, only for the menu. The passives work without it.
[/list]
Built and tested on SE 1.5.97. No VR build.

[line]

